  "answer": "For your short-haul flight that arrived 3.5 hours late due to a technical fault, you are entitled to compensation of EUR 200. Technical faults are considered within Corvina's control, so you will receive the full compensation amount. Please note that you must submit your claim through the online form within 12 months of the flight date, and the compensation will be paid by bank transfer within 30 days or as a travel voucher worth 130% of the amount, valid for 12 months.",
